**Cheatsheet Summary**

• **Context upfront** — Frame discussions with Context -> Problem -> Solution.
• **Face-to-face** — Preferred for feedback & high-bandwidth alignment.
• **Support the bugs** — Echo back excited ideas, tag urgency, protect focus.
• **Respect focus time** — Pre-notify check-ins & give reasons for rejections.
:::

